  "body": "Every family home has a story and 5 King Richard Place has been the setting for many special chapters. From family celebrations and precious milestones to sunny afternoons spent around the swimming pool, this is a home that has been truly loved. Now, the owners are ready to move on, giving the next family an opportunity to create their own memories here.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n- Solid concrete block, single-level home\r\n- Generous 726m2 flat section\r\n- Four bedrooms in the main home, including master ensuite\r\n- Separate self-contained one-bedroom accommodation\r\n- Recently renovated kitchen and open-plan dining\r\n- Sunny private garden and swimming pool\r\n- Potential for future development or subdivision, subject to council approval\r\n- Great school zone, close to Browns Bay village and Sherwood Reserve\r\n- Covered carport and ample off-street parking\r\n\r\nSet on a generous 726m2 flat section, this solid concrete block home offers comfortable single-level living, excellent indoor-outdoor flow and plenty of room for the whole family. The recently renovated kitchen connects beautifully with the open-plan dining area, while the central living and lounge spaces create a welcoming setting for everyday life and entertaining. Step outside to a sunny, private garden and beautiful swimming pool - perfect for making the most of summer.\r\n\r\nThe main home features four bedrooms, including a master with ensuite. Adding even more flexibility is separate self-contained accommodation with its own living area, bedroom and bathroom - ideal for extended family, guests or potential Airbnb income.\r\n\r\nBeyond what is already here, the flat land and existing underground services offer potential for future development or subdivision, subject to council approval and relevant requirements.\r\n\r\nLocated within a great school zone, with Browns Bay village within walking distance and Sherwood Reserve nearby, this is a property that brings together family living, convenience and future possibilities.\r\n\r\nThe owners have enjoyed many wonderful years here and are motivated to move on. Now it's your turn to make this home yours.",
